  "_doc": "ui-spec page id → v4 route. honest_page = the whole page is a declared 'Not simulated in Vyomi' gap, allowed ONLY for products on consoles/honest-allowlist.json (base branch); lambda has no allowlist entry, so Applications/EC2 capacity providers/code signing/MicroVMs+network connectors/Lambda@Edge replicas/Step Functions cross-link are all built for real — see core/capabilities/aws/lambda.json for what's genuinely simulated vs stored-only. Unlisted spec pages count as missing.",
